1
00:00:00,983 --> 00:00:04,323
Leonard and Penny. Leonard and Penny.
Leonard and Penny.

2
00:00:04,487 --> 00:00:05,657
(Sheldon:)Oh, my--

3
00:00:05,821 --> 00:00:08,611
(Leonard:)God, Sheldon.

4
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:14,540
(Leonard:)What the hell are you doing
out there?

5
00:00:16,499 --> 00:00:18,459
(Sheldon:)I heard a noise.

6
00:00:20,044 --> 00:00:23,174
(Leonard:)It was us.
We knocked over a lamp.

7
00:00:23,339 --> 00:00:26,049
(Sheldon:)-Why would you knock over a lamp?
-We were gonna--

8
00:00:26,217 --> 00:00:30,307
(Penny:)He doesn't need to know
what we were doing, Leonard.

9
00:00:30,471 --> 00:00:31,971
(Raj:)Oh.

10
00:00:32,973 --> 00:00:36,313
(Sheldon:)No, she's right. I don't need to know
what you were doing.

11
00:00:36,477 --> 00:00:41,147
(Sheldon:)-Carry on.
-What are you doing? Use the door.

12
00:00:41,315 --> 00:00:43,485
(Sheldon:)Good thinking.

13
00:00:43,651 --> 00:00:47,361
Hey, perhaps I'll check the perimeter
and make some warm milk.

